{"generated": "2026-10-23 17:40", "brief": "<b>1. SK하이닉스의 솔리다임 IPO 검토 중단</b>\nSK하이닉스가 미국 자회사 솔리다임의 IPO 검토를 시장 여건 등을 이유로 전격 중단했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE5rWXZwTmtmTHdOcUpNQlFjQU1zdTh6YjZqTjBMVV81VTNhc08zOUMwMTFxQ0NyUUZraHB1LWZEcGpnck5FVGFiUGIzUW5CVkhlYkJ1R2h4WTlpd3BJVmFFMDlkX1VkVzREUXc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#19</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5BYk9ETG5oczNhUi1yTlFXLU9kTjUxWTBPREhEQ2cydkZ3NFBuOXBQVHZWWFRycDhad3dDZ210MEJZdHlvYjRzUDRnbXJWdWNuY3Nnd0NtZkJWb0E4aVE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#28</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE4xTkVsWHZ0Sjdvb0VwVVQ4TDdxazYybFNROXplNi1EZVVsa1ROeGVQRlk0QWxUdXdZeThTMERHNXNENzdNeUo1RG5BY2xLUVVteFE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#30</a>]. 이에 따라 주주가치 제고 기대감이 반영되며 시장에서는 주가가 반등하는 등 긍정적 반응이 나타났습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTFA0STRLeEFYXy0tWVpGdWhFQUhnUDRwS1p4NVJ3SHBzb3FaellrS21CTVlLMVNBc2tWZmVSb3dpR3BId0s5TkZZbHVjNHFWeXRyZDctaGl3NEh6TFY1a2phVw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#20</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE5iR3VFQmVnbGE2aXBCLUNkMHB2Y2Y5UWFFLU1aN3lkbHJ4Nk5EaER2Q0tLUFJWMVFHNUROVURXNVBXemJnZ2k3bzhiZWtnMkdJRjhRYjFQQWZCZDRXWDhTRnUwLVdfTUY1T1E?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#27</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTFB6aFRJNjZ0V1ZaQmdvNjhWN3NmVG5UQWFPSkNrLWxGU2U4Q2JkOXhnU0NQQ3JGd09yWkdLM08tcmkwck4tYjRxVjRUd1dGTkJtdDZieHBKZ09iTGNlbnRIWEN5VWY?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#33</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE9Gc28xZ0FFQV8wWmlnS1hDZGJSWHRFV3I4S2FGLXZVRS1BeHBQbU5IUGxSWkNSSk9PR212MXVtQWNnQ3RqcEEwRUZqZW1JS3Bqa1UzeHc4TGhQcEVtRVVvNzk5VXFiUWQ5N0E?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#40</a>].\n\n<b>2. 바이오·헬스케어 스타트업 대규모 자금 집행</b>\nADC 신약 개발기업 트리오어가 330억 원 규모의 시리즈C 투자를 유치하며 누적 투자금 770억 원을 확보했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3l